Package: yarraclean
Type: Package
Title: Cleaning and Visualization Tools for Yarra River data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Hendrickson Joewono", "You",
      email = "hyou0019@student.monash.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides a cleaned and analysis-ready version of the Yarra River
    water quality dataset, prepared from the original monitoring data published
    by the Victorian Department of Energy, Environment, and Climate Action. 
    The package contains the processed dataset and a Shiny app launcher 
    function (`run_app()`) for interactive exploration of trends in pH, 
    turbidity, salinity, nitrogen and water temperature. The pyurpose of this 
    package is to supply a curated environmental dataset for teaching, 
    visualisation and reproducible research.

